@startuml
'https://plantuml.com/class-diagram

:**Source Data (CSV / API)**
e.g. iNaturalist, GBIF, other datasets;

:**Ingestion Script** reads raw data and iterates over records.

**Files: scripts/...**
* Reads through the CSV or API data
* Loops through each record
* Orchestrates the overall process;

:**Parsing & Conversion** converts source formats to Python types
(dates, datetimes, UUIDs, numbers, etc).

**Files: src/leopard_id/ingestion/...**
* Converts strings to correct types
* Handles source-specific formats
* Builds a clean data structure for validation;

:**Validation Layer** runs reusable checks and returns a list
of issues (if any).

**Files: src/leopard_id/validation**
* Common checks (lat/long, dates, datetimes, etc)
* Observation-specific checks
* Returns a list of issues (doesn't raise immediately);

if (Is the record valid?) then (yes)
:**Duplicate Check** looks up existing record
before inserting;<<#palegreen>>

:**Repository** handles database operations; <<#palegreen>>

:**Database** stores the record in PostgreSQL
(with unique constraints); <<#lightcyan>>


else (no)
:**Log/Report issue** - collect and record errors

**Files: src/leopard_id/logging/...**
* Records validation issues
* Reports skipped records
* Helps with debugging and monitoring; <<#pink>>

:**Skip Record**; <<#pink>>
kill
endif

:**Imported**
Record added successfully to the database;<<#lightcyan>>

@enduml